---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { loadCatalogue } from '../lib/catalogue/repository';

const catalogue = await loadCatalogue(Astro.locals);
const { contactEmail, leadRetentionMonths } = catalogue.settings;
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What personal data DevMsr.in collects through this website, why, who processes it, how long it is kept and how to ask for it to be corrected or deleted."
  path="/privacy"
  updated="2026-10-12"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information DevMsr.in (“we”) collects when you use this website, why we collect it, and the choices you have. It
    describes how this website actually works; if that changes, we will update this page.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you send a contact, quote or demo request, we collect what you type into the form:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name and email address (required)</li>
    <li>Your industry, the service you are interested in and a description of your project (required)</li>
    <li>Optionally: business name, phone or WhatsApp number, budget range, timeline, preferred contact method, existing website and preferred consultation time</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We also record a small amount of technical information with each request:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The time of submission and the page or campaign link you came from (referrer and UTM parameters), if available</li>
    <li>
      A one-way hashed form of your IP address, used only to limit repeated or automated submissions. We do not store your IP address
      itself.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use advertising cookies or third-party analytics trackers on this website.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry, understand your requirements and prepare a quote</li>
    <li>To follow up about the same enquiry using the contact method you prefer</li>
    <li>To protect the website and our inbox from spam and abuse</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your information, and we do not add you to marketing lists without asking.</p>

  <h2>Who processes it</h2>
  <p>We use a small number of service providers to run this website. They process data on our behalf:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — database hosting for enquiries and website content</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting, security, and the Turnstile check that tells people and bots apart</li>
    <li><strong>Resend</strong> — delivery of notification and acknowledgement emails</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers may process data on servers outside India.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If you choose a light or dark theme, that preference is stored in your browser’s local storage. It is not sent to us.</li>
    <li>The Cloudflare Turnstile check may set cookies that are necessary for it to work.</li>
    <li>Staff who sign in to the private admin area receive secure session cookies. Visitors do not.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries are kept for up to {leadRetentionMonths} months after our last contact with you and then deleted, unless you become a client — in
    which case we keep project records for as long as the engagement and applicable legal obligations require.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to show you the information we hold about you, correct it, or delete it, and you can withdraw your consent to further contact
    at any time. Use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>{contactEmail ? <> or email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a></> : null}
    and mention your enquiry reference number if you have one. We will respond within a reasonable time.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries are validated and stored on the server. Database access is restricted with row-level security, and only authorised staff can sign
    in to view enquiries. No method of storage or transmission is completely secure, but we work to protect your information and to limit what we
    collect.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is intended for businesses and is not directed at children.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We will post any changes to this policy on this page and update the date above.</p>
</LegalLayout>
